<listitem><content>
<para>Any of IRS_SWERR_STATUSR.{V, OF} are nonzero before the write.</para>
</content>
</listitem><listitem><content>
<para>The write does not clear the nonzero IRS_SWERR_STATUSR.{V, OF} fields to zero by writing ones to the applicable field or fields.</para>
</content>
</listitem></list>
